.TH SDL_CreateGPURenderState 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_CreateGPURenderState \- Create custom GPU render state.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_render.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_GPURenderState * SDL_CreateGPURenderState(SDL_Renderer *renderer, const SDL_GPURenderStateCreateInfo *createinfo);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I renderer
the renderer to use\[char46]
.TP
.I createinfo
a struct describing the GPU render state to create\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a custom GPU render state or NULL on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should be called on the thread that created the renderer\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

